    "## ✅ SOLUTION: Use Mean or Trimmed Mean Instead of Median\n",
    "\n",
    "The median is misleading because:\n",
    "- **2020**: Few firms with extreme spreads, most firms near zero → Median stays low\n",
    "- **2023**: More firms with elevated spreads → Median increases\n",
    "\n",
    "The **mean** correctly captures the overall credit risk in the market.\n",
    "The **median** only tells you about the \"typical\" firm, which isn't representative when distribution is highly skewed."
   ]
